  "name": "Frozen channel",
  "description": "Greybox reference puzzle for freezing and levitation (mw-e15.9): a 6 m channel of water above a 2 m trench splits a 12 m hall in two, and the portcullis in the north wall opens when the pressure pad on the far bank is weighed for a second. A person's 90 kg does it and so does a 12 kg crate, so there are two ways: freeze the surface into walkable ice (any cold stimulus) and walk across, or lift the crate over the water with Mage Hand and set it on the pad. The 2 m trench cannot be climbed out of and crates sink (there is no buoyancy yet, mw-e03.14), which is why those routes are not declared. Reach it with ?scene=frozen-channel.",
